2. test_nu_wall_geometry_scaling
================================================================================

Edit (in compute_nu_wall):

--- a/rmgpy/solver/plasma.pyx
+++ b/rmgpy/solver/plasma.pyx
@@ compute_nu_wall
-        return d_a / (lam * lam)
+        return d_a / lam

Rationale: drops the square on Lambda, so nu_wall scales as 1/Lambda instead of 1/Lambda**2 --
breaking both the "halving Lambda**2 doubles nu_wall" assertion and the "nu_wall*Lambda**2 constant
across radii" assertion.

