3. test_wall_loss_is_first_order_in_electron_population
================================================================================

Edit (in _apply_wall_terms, the charged-species loss loop):

--- a/rmgpy/solver/plasma.pyx
+++ b/rmgpy/solver/plasma.pyx
@@ _apply_wall_terms
-            loss = nu * y[j]
+            loss = nu * y[j] * y[j]

Rationale: makes the per-species wall loss quadratic in the species' own amount instead of
linear, breaking the pinned "-(wall flux)/N_e == nu_wall exactly" identity (first order in the
electron population).

